{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061906/block/singleImage/3257290/df/01M6J5H6P4TEMRHVFSFMN2QCDG.jpeg?updatedAt=1793758706\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀住宅闢毒品倉，警拘28歲女檢11.7萬元霹靂可卡因。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>九龍城警區特別職務隊人員根據線報及經深入調查，昨晚 (3 日 ) 在尖沙咀加連威老道展開反毒品行動，搗破一個懷疑毒品儲存及分銷中心。 行動中，人員突擊搜查一住宅單位，檢獲約 107 克懷疑霹靂可卡因及一批毒品包裝工具，毒品市值約 11.7 萬元，並以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」拘捕單位內一名 28 歲本地女子，她現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:44:50.767436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.192627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:27.966516+00:00","content_hash":"e6051e5c1d8c5d2cdd2a8dd0f778e9cf65532c21785e8745ba2dbc926017f8aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:44:50.767436+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}